  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO- Comprehensive sexuality education (CSE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Comprehensive Sexuality Education in support of UNESCOs strategy on Education for Health and Wellbeing. Comprehensive Sexuality Education prepares young people for a safe and fulfilling life. It enables them to make informed decisions about relationships and sexuality, and to better protect themselves against gender-based violence, early and unintended pregnancies, HIV and other sexually transmitted infections</narrative>
  </description>
